0, 0)\">35% of users fail to fully render a face swap video, and 15% experience dead clicks</h3>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 412, "h": 151, "flex": "column|0px|24px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 380, "h": 103, "flex": "row|16px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"bg": "rgb(83, 4, 254)", "t": "box", "w": 3, "h": 103, "clip": 1, "kids": [], "empty": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 380, "h": 103, "flex": "column|4px|4px 0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 380, "h": 24, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--ui);font-size:24px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:600\">25% conversion rate</h5>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 380, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\">Magic Hour’s Face Swap product flow drives the highest upgrade rate from the free plan to premium.</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "br": "0px 10px 10px 0px", "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "br": "8px", "bg": "rgba(83, 4, 254, 0.05)", "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 372, "h": 256, "frame": 1, "br": "0px", "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 371.37, "h": 268.8, "src": "/images/cs/I4ldDG33zASWhGBMHQcBRyXLR4.webp", "fit": "fill", "abs": [0, -6.38]}]}], "fill": 1, "stack": 1}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 760, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The existing design is convoluted</h3>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 720, "flex": "column|16px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 343, "flex": "row|24px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 550, "h": 343, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 550, "h": 343, "src": "/images/cs/mh-initial-flow-still.png", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0], "br": "8px"}], "frame": 1, "br": "8px"}, {"t": "box", "w": 226, "h": 200, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);font-style:italic;font-weight:700\">Initial Design</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">❗ Waits until the end of the product flow to tell users that they are over the frame rate</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">❗ Does not clearly tell users the number of frames they have</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">❗ Uncertainty of length of process</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "stack": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 359, "flex": "row|24px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "iframe", "w": 550, "h": 359, "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/6kbk_XtxXQ8?v=6kbk_XtxXQ8&t=5s&iv_load_policy=3&rel=0&modestbranding=1&playsinline=1&autoplay=1&mute=1&loop=1&playlist=6kbk_XtxXQ8&color=white", "br": "8px"}, {"t": "box", "w": 226, "h": 200, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);font-style:italic;font-weight:700\">Redesign</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">✅ Clearly tells users how many frames they have &amp; need</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">✅ Sleek UI</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">✅ Allows for in-depth face swap capabilities for users who need it</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "stack": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "id": "02-problem", "reveal": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 450, "flex": "column|32px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 330, "flex": "column|16px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(82, 4, 254)\">RESEARCH &amp; PLANNING</h5>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 290, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Synthesizing preliminary user tests</h3>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">I first conducted a cognitive walkthrough of the initial product flow. My unfamiliarity with Magic Hour's platform as a new user helped me identify potential issues that led to early drop-offs, and UX confusions.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">When I joined Magic Hour, they had 12 user test screen recordings. I watched all the screen recordings, and noticed that the majority of user dissatisfaction came from one of the following pain points:</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 126, "flex": "row|40px|16px 0px 0px 20px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 240, "h": 110, "flex": "row|8px|8px 16px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 22, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\" data-align=\"center\">01</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 170, "h": 100, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\">Confusing UX</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 170, "h": 57, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">Features such as \"multi-face swap\" and uploading a Youtube video are not immediately obvious to the user.</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1, "bd": {"left": "3px solid rgb(184, 184, 184)"}}, {"t": "box", "w": 240, "h": 110, "flex": "row|8px|8px 16px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 22, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\" data-align=\"center\">02</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 170, "h": 100, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\">Lack of Cost Transparency</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 170, "h": 57, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">Users are only told about potential price warnings after they have completed the entire flow.</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1, "bd": {"left": "3px solid rgb(184, 184, 184)"}}, {"t": "box", "w": 240, "h": 110, "flex": "row|8px|8px 16px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 22, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\" data-align=\"center\">03</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 170, "h": 100, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\">Lack of readily available assets</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 170, "h": 57, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">Many users did not have a clear headshot on their device that could be used to swap faces.</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1, "bd": {"left": "3px solid rgb(184, 184, 184)"}}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1, "stack": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 80, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Prototyping and testing over a/b tests</h3>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">This was my first project as a remote designer. I was concerned about the amount of additional work it would take to implement a/b tests. I decided to create Figma prototypes and conduct user tests.</p>", "single": false}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "id": "03-research", "reveal": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 3100, "flex": "column|32px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 780, "flex": "column|16px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(82, 4, 254)\">PROTOTYPING</h5>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 740, "flex": "column|12px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">A single page layout allows users to anticipate next steps and the length of the process</h3>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">My first intuition was to reduce the product flow to a single page. Having all the information clearly laid out gives a good idea of how many steps are next, and reduces unnecessary clicking. I made two low fidelity prototypes, one with each step as a toggle and the other without.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">A potential concern with the collapsed dropdowns is that it could lead to slightly higher drop-off, as the user has to click a tab before they proceed, as opposed to the initial design where they would see the upload box immediately.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 537, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 800, "h": 537, "src": "/images/cs/gFPkDfKBHLmTJZpSyMZIU8Ces.webp", "fit": "contain", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0], "br": "16px"}], "frame": 1, "fill": 1, "br": "16px"}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 500, "flex": "column|12px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">An assets panel so users don’t have to dig through their files for a portrait photo</h3>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">I created an assets panel with curated face portraits and recently uploaded photos to reduce friction in the face swap flow. A/B testing showed an <strong style=\"font-weight:600\">80% reduction in user drop-off.</strong> The assets doubled as examples that helped users understand which photos work best.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 392.25, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 600, "h": 392.25, "src": "/images/cs/EHlOdrTKxuLmxzYsKB1rFoGaFp4.webp", "fit": "contain", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0], "br": "6px"}], "frame": 1, "br": "6px"}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 900, "flex": "column|12px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Cost transparency reduces dropoff and decreases deadclicks</h3>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">The moment we are able to discern that users may not be able to render their video, it is important to notify the user to reduce frustration. This is also a high-impact conversion point for users to purchase more frames.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 373.77, "frame": 1, "br": "8px", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 372.71, "frame": 1, "br": "6.361px", "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 600, "h": 411.09, "src": "/images/cs/mh-redesign-flow.png", "fit": "fill", "abs": [0, 0]}], "abs": [0, 1.06]}, {"t": "img", "w": 599.94, "h": 373.77, "src": "/images/cs/mh-spotlight.svg", "fit": "fill", "abs": [0, 0], "blend": "multiply"}, {"t": "box", "w": 172.55, "h": 66.37, "frame": 1, "br": "7.936px", "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 748.6, "h": 512.95, "src": "/images/cs/mh-redesign-flow.png", "fit": "fill", "abs": [-188.48, -336.53]}], "abs": [127.42, 261.21], "bd": {"top": "0.75px solid rgb(85, 85, 85)", "right": "0.75px solid rgb(85, 85, 85)", "bottom": "0.75px solid rgb(85, 85, 85)", "left": "0.75px solid rgb(85, 85, 85)"}}]}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 374.07, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 600, "h": 374.07, "src": "/images/cs/mh-frames-warning.png", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0], "br": "8px"}], "frame": 1, "br": "8px"}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 900, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Reserving GPU-intensive capabilities for high-intent users</h3>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">When face swapping, users have two options:</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 42, "html": "<ul style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600\">Swap all faces:</strong> Upload one photo and replace all faces in the video with that one photo</li><li><strong style=\"font-weight:600\">Multi face swap:</strong> Select specific faces to swap with other faces</li></ul>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">Only 2% of users who created a video used the \"Multi-face Swap\" function. We felt this percentage was disproportionately low. I suspected it was because the term \"Multi-face Swap\" doesn't make its own function apparently clear.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 90, "flex": "row|0px|8px 0px 0px 20px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 780, "h": 110, "flex": "row|8px|8px 16px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 710, "h": 100, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic\">GPU considerations for multi-face swap</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 710, "h": 57, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">Swapping multiple faces in a video is useful, but very GPU intensive. Thus, specific face-swap features should be reserved only for high intent users.</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1, "bd": {"left": "3px solid rgb(184, 184, 184)"}}], "fill": 1, "clip": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 600, "flex": "column|24px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 251, "flex": "row|24px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 226, "h": 200, "flex": "column|12px|52px 0px 0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);font-style:italic;font-weight:700\">Initial Design</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">✅ Not intensive on GPU</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">✅ Minimal clicks</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">❗ Multi Face Swap is used <strong style=\"font-weight:600\">2% of the time</strong></p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 550, "h": 251, "frame": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 550, "h": 200.92, "frame": 1, "br": "6.548px", "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 550.06, "h": 334.2, "src": "/images/cs/mh-gpu-initial.png", "fit": "fill", "abs": [0, 0]}], "abs": [0, 49.82]}, {"t": "text", "w": 135.9, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);font-style:italic\">Low visibility segmented button</p>", "single": false, "abs": [380.83, 0]}, {"t": "box", "w": 143.67, "h": 2, "kids": [], "abs": [380.83, 40], "bd": {"top": "2px solid rgb(184, 184, 184)"}}]}], "fill": 1, "stack": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 316, "flex": "row|45px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 205, "h": 200, "flex": "column|12px|52px 0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 205, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);font-style:italic;font-weight:700\">Redesign w/ GPU considerations</p>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">✅ Easily allows for more customization if needed</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">✅ Not intensive on GPU</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">✅ Minimal friction</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 226, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);padding-left:22px;text-indent:-22px\">❗ Opening specific face swap toggle may be overwhelming to user</p>", "single": false, "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 550, "h": 316, "frame": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 550, "h": 264.5, "frame": 1, "br": "5.137px", "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 550.06, "h": 357.53, "src": "/images/cs/mh-gpu-redesign.png", "fit": "fill", "abs": [0, -49.91]}], "abs": [0, 51.5]}, {"t": "text", "w": 203.26, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);font-style:italic\">First image upload swaps all faces in the video</p>", "single": false, "abs": [85.42, 0]}, {"t": "box", "w": 191.14, "h": 2, "kids": [], "abs": [85.42, 40], "bd": {"top": "2px solid rgb(184, 184, 184)"}}, {"t": "text", "w": 200.15, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85);font-style:italic\">A specific face can be customized within the toggle</p>", "single": false, "abs": [300, 0]}, {"t": "box", "w": 250, "h": 2, "kids": [], "abs": [300, 40], "bd": {"top": "2px solid rgb(184, 184, 184)"}}]}], "fill": 1, "stack": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "id": "04-prototype", "reveal": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 960, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(82, 4, 254)\">VISUALS</h5>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 930, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Prioritizing minimalism &amp; clarity</h3>", "single": false, "fill": 1}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102)\">Several UI changes were made to adhere to Magic Hour’s new branding, as well as create a more premium look and feel.</p>", "single": false}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 845, "flex": "column|20px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 395, "flex": "column|4px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102);font-style:italic\">Initial Design</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 371.52, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 600, "h": 371.52, "src": "/images/cs/mh-visuals-initial.png", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0], "br": "8px"}], "frame": 1, "br": "8px"}]}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 428, "flex": "column|4px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 19, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(102, 102, 102);font-style:italic\">Redesign</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 404.9, "frame": 1, "br": "11.981px", "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 600, "h": 411.09, "src": "/images/cs/mh-redesign-flow.png", "fit": "fill", "abs": [0, 0]}]}]}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1, "id": "05-visuals", "reveal": 1, "clip": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 800, "h": 340, "flex": "column|16px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 800, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(82, 4, 254)\">REFLECTION</h5>", "single": true, "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 300, "flex": "column|12px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 120, "flex": "column|4px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The impact of content design</h3>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">The confusion caused by the term \"multi-face swap\" was a challenging problem to handle. It was the first time I concretely and immediately felt the impacts of sub-optimized terminology and content design. I had a lot of fun diving into content design principles, and referred to Andy Welfle and Michael J. Metts' book \"Writing is Designing\" as a frame of reference.</p>", "single": false}]}, {"t": "box", "w": 600, "h": 120, "flex": "column|4px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 32, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:32px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Optimizing user tests</h3>", "single": false}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 38, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(85, 85, 85)\">Finding a balance between making changes and conducting user tests was very important. It was easy to want to validate every small design decision I made, but conducting user tests takes a lot of time and resources ultimately slowing down the entire design process. At a startup like Magic Hour, designs must be executed quickly so I found myself making a mental note of when I should best conduct user tests, and make small tweaks between each tester.</p>", "single": false}]}]}], "fill": 1, "id": "06-reflection", "reveal": 1, "clip": 1}]}, "accent": "rgb(82, 4, 254)"}